HFUT-Schedule iOS port

This directory contains a new SwiftUI implementation derived from the feature
surface, service definitions, visual identity, and documentation of
Chiu-xaH/HFUT-Schedule.

Original project: https://github.com/Chiu-xaH/HFUT-Schedule
Original license: Apache License 2.0

Changes in this derivative work include a native SwiftUI application structure,
iOS service equivalents, an iOS feature catalog, Liquid Glass presentation,
local schedule storage, EventKit export, VisionKit scanning, and WKWebView-based
campus portal access.
